title: "Replica-Aware Validation of Machine Learning for Reliable Interpretation of Molecular Dynamics Trajectories: Cav3.1 Reproducibility Package"
type: software
abstract: "Code, processed replica-level structural features, initial structures, example trajectories, configurations, and validated results for replica-aware machine-learning analysis of apo, Z944-bound, and mZ944-bound human Cav3.1 molecular dynamics trajectories."
